#: aequilibrae/paths/results/path_results.py:163
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Updates the path's nodes, links, skims and mileposts\n"
"\n"
"        If the previously computed path had `early_exit` enabled, `update_trace` will check if the\n"
"        `destination` has already been found, if not the shortest path tree will be recomputed with the `early_exit`\n"
"        argument passed on.\n"
"\n"
"        If the previously computed path had `a_star` enabled, `update_trace` always recompute the path.\n"
"\n"
"        :Arguments:\n"
"            **destination** (:obj:`int`): ID of the node we are computing the path too\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Actualiza los nodos, enlaces, líneas y hitos de la ruta.\n"
"\n"
"        Si la ruta calculada previamente tenía habilitada `early_exit`, `update_trace` verificará si la\n"
"        El `destino` ya se ha encontrado; de lo contrario, el árbol de ruta más corto se volverá a calcular con la "
"`early_exit`\n"
"        argumento transmitido.\n"
"\n"
"        Si la ruta calculada previamente tenía `a_star` habilitada, `update_trace` siempre vuelve a calcular la ruta."
"\n"
"\n"
"        :Argumentos:\n"
"            **destino** (:obj:`int`): ID del nodo cuya ruta también estamos calculando"

