#: aequilibrae/transit/transit.py:160
msgid ""
"Builds a preload vector for the transit network over the specified time period\n"
"\n"
"        :Arguments:\n"
"            **start** (:obj:`int`): The start of the period for which to check pt schedules (seconds from midnight)\n"
"\n"
"            **end** (:obj:`int`): The end of the period for which to check pt schedules, (seconds from midnight)\n"
"\n"
"            **inclusion_cond** (:obj:`str`): Specifies condition with which to include/exclude pt trips from the\n"
"            preload.\n"
"\n"
"        :Returns:\n"
"            **preloads** (:obj:`pd.DataFrame`): A DataFrame of preload from transit vehicles that can be directly "
"used\n"
"            in an assignment\n"
"\n"
"        .. code-block:: python\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project = create_example(project_path, \"coquimbo\")\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project.network.build_graphs()\n"
"\n"
"            >>> start = int(6.5 * 60 * 60) # 6:30 am\n"
"            >>> end = int(8.5 * 60 * 60)   # 8:30 am\n"
"\n"
"            >>> transit = Transit(project)\n"
"            >>> preload = transit.build_pt_preload(start, end)\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project.close()\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Crea un vector de precarga para la red de tránsito durante el período de tiempo especificado\n"
"\n"
"        :Argumentos:\n"
"            **inicio** (:obj:`int`): El inicio del período para verificar los horarios de puntos (segundos desde la "
"medianoche)\n"
"\n"
"            **end** (:obj:`int`): El final del período para verificar los horarios de puntos (segundos a partir de la"
" medianoche)\n"
"\n"
"            **inclusion_cond** (:obj:`str`): Especifica la condición con la cual incluir/excluir viajes pt del\n"
"            precarga.\n"
"\n"
"        :Devoluciones:\n"
"            **precargas** (:obj:`pd.DataFrame`): un marco de datos de precarga de vehículos de tránsito que se puede "
"usar directamente\n"
"            en una tarea\n"
"\n"
"        .. bloque de código:: python\n"
"\n"
"            >>> proyecto = crear_ejemplo(ruta_proyecto, \"coquimbo\")\n"
"\n"
"            >>> proyecto.network.build_graphs()\n"
"\n"
"            >>> inicio = int(6.5 * 60 * 60) # 6:30 a.m.\n"
