#: aequilibrae/transit/transit_elements/pattern.py:119
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Map matches the route into the network, considering its appropriate shape.\n"
"\n"
"        Part of the map-matching process is to find the network links corresponding the pattern's\n"
"        raw shape, so that method will be called in case it has not been called before.\n"
"\n"
"        The basic algorithm behind the map-matching algorithm is described in https://doi.org/10.3141%2F2646-08\n"
"\n"
"        In a nutshell, we compute the shortest path between the nodes corresponding to the links to which\n"
"        stops were geographically matched, for each pair of identified links.\n"
"\n"
"        We do not consider links that are in perfect sequence, as we found that it introduces severe issues when\n"
"        stops are close to intersections without clear upsides.\n"
"\n"
"        When issues are found, we remove the stops in the immediate vicinity of the issue and attempt new\n"
"        path finding. The First and last stops/corresponding links are always kept.\n"
"\n"
"        If an error was found, (record for it will show in the log), it is stored within the object.\n"
"\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"El mapa relaciona la ruta de entrada a la red, considerando su forma adecuada.\n"
"\n"
"        Parte del proceso de comparación de mapas es encontrar los enlaces de red correspondientes al patrón.\n"
"        forma sin formato, por lo que se llamará ese método en caso de que no se haya llamado antes.\n"
"\n"
"        El algoritmo básico detrás del algoritmo de coincidencia de mapas se describe en "
"https://doi.org/10.3141%2F2646-08.\n"
"\n"
"        En pocas palabras, calculamos el camino más corto entre los nodos correspondientes a los enlaces a los que\n"
"        las paradas se emparejaron geográficamente, para cada par de enlaces identificados.\n"
"\n"
"        No consideramos enlaces que estén en secuencia perfecta, ya que descubrimos que introduce problemas graves "
"cuando\n"
"        las paradas están cerca de intersecciones sin ventajas claras.\n"
"\n"
"        Cuando se encuentran problemas, eliminamos las paradas en las inmediaciones del problema e intentamos nuevas\n"
"        búsqueda de camino. La primera y la última parada/enlaces correspondientes siempre se conservan.\n"
"\n"
"        Si se encuentra un error (el registro se mostrará en el registro), se almacena dentro del objeto."

